  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "a_t10_i01_npc_03_01",
      "hash64": "6DEE340AD5E42AF7",
      "text": "居民會館是地區居民\\n聚在一起學習、交流，\\r\\n以及休息的地方喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "a_t10_i01_npc_03_02",
      "hash64": "6DEE350AD5E42CAA",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳去過慶典了嗎？\\n慶典還會舉辦一陣子，[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳要玩個開心喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "a_t10_i01_npc_03_03",
      "hash64": "6DEE360AD5E42E5D",
      "text": "我聽到寶伴廣場那裡\\n傳來了好大的聲響……\\r\\n但我們又沒有計劃要放煙火啊。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "a_t10_i01_npc_03_04",
      "hash64": "6DEE2F0AD5E42278",
      "text": "我萬萬沒想到厄鬼椪\\n竟然長得那麼可愛！\\c\\n……也許我該去找管理員商量一下，\\n看可不可以做些厄鬼椪的周邊商品？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "a_t10_i01_npc_04_01",
      "hash64": "9DE024348DAB6DFC",
      "text": "說到帕底亞地區，\\n那裡有間很大的學校吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "a_t10_i01_npc_04_02",
      "hash64": "9DE027348DAB7315",
      "text": "說到慶典，怎麼能沒有刨冰！\\c\\n我推薦[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳吃藍色阿羅拉口味喔。\\n……舌頭會變藍就是了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "a_t10_i01_npc_04_03",
      "hash64": "9DE026348DAB7162",
      "text": "我總覺得外面鬧哄哄的，\\n難不成是寶伴復活了？\\r\\n……才～怪呢，說笑而已，呵呵呵！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "a_t10_i01_npc_04_04",
      "hash64": "9DE021348DAB68E3",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳見到厄鬼椪了嗎！？\\c\\n我猜明年的慶典啊，\\n鬼面具一定會大受歡迎！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
